  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate machine learning in business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Hugging Face is a leading provider of state-of-the-art natural language processing (NLP) technologies. It offers many pre-trained models, including popular ones such as BERT, GPT (including OpenAI's GPT-3), and DistilBERT, which can be used for a wide range of applications such as text classification, translation, summarization, and more. This Connector enables you to integrate machine learning into BPMN-based processes by using the Hugging Face Inference API.",
